      </div>
      <div class="about-body">
        <p>Hair&amp;Crew Saloons is a premium salon built around one idea — that beauty should feel personal, not procedural. Every visit is shaped around your skin, your hair, and how you want to feel when you leave.</p>
        <p>From signature facials to considered waxing rituals, our stylists work with premium products and an unhurried pace, across our Gurugram studios and in the comfort of your own home.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="section-eyebrow">Why Hair&amp;Crew Saloons</div>
        <h2>A studio built on detail</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="why-grid" id="whyGrid"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="home-services">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="section-eyebrow">Featured</div>
        <h2>Featured services</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="feat-grid" id="featGrid"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="section-eyebrow">Signature Experience</div>
        <h2>Where to begin</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="wrap" style="padding:0;">
      <div class="sig-row" id="sigRow"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

